  <diagram id="01-analytical-lifecycle" name="01-analytical-lifecycle" description="Five phases drawn as a circuit, read clockwise, each in a filled box. Phases 1, 2 and 3 run left to right across the top. An arrow comes down the right-hand side to Phase 4. An arrow runs back along the bottom to Phase 5. A green arrow goes up the left-hand side from Phase 5 to Phase 1, closing the loop, and is marked: lessons go into the next scoping. Phase 1 is engagement and scoping, phase 2 design, phase 3 analysis, phase 4 delivery, communication and sign-off, and phase 5 review. Phase 5 is green and the other four are blue. A panel below is headed running through all five phases, and reads: quality assurance and customer and stakeholder engagement.">
